    "profile": {
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "HTML",
          "html": "Sandeep Gupta was a right-hand batsman and a wicketkeeper who was included in Kenya's 1999 World Cup squad. He made his debut for Kenya in 1990, playing for them ten times but, remarkably, failing to take a catch or make a stumping.  His highest score was 41 against Sri Lanka in 1996.  He represented his country in the 1990, 1994 and 1997 ICC Trophy  and has toured Holland, Malaysia and South Africa. <BR><B>Victor Isaacs</b>"
        }
      ]
    },
